tag_description=
**Charts:**
**1. ska-tmc-integration 0.19.1 - 0.19.2*

    **1.1 ska-tmc-mid - 0.19.1 - 0.19.2:
        a. Updated Subarray Node to v0.18.0 that resolves the SKB-331 and gets rid of hardcoded interface values
        b. Fix bug SKB-337
        c. Updated the kValue range to 1 to 1177.
        d. kValue range is a device property
        e. Configure command gets accepted if the kvalue for assinged dishes 
            are either all same or all different


